 # Algorithmic Modifications and Improvements
 ## Overview
-This family covers algorithmic variants of the Marching Cubes isosurface extraction method that modify input data, lookup logic, vertex placement, or post-processing to address topological ambiguity, mesh quality, computational efficiency, or data uncertainty. It sets itself apart from standard MC by introducing preprocessing, dynamic state propagation, geometric snapping, or error-aware interpolation to resolve artifacts, speed up processing, or attach metadata to the surface.
