 ## Shared principles
-All variants operate on a structured 3D grid and produce a triangle mesh, building on [Marching Cubes Lookup and Configuration](2518-marching-cubes-lookup-and-configuration.md). The core mechanism of determining edge intersections via a case index (derived from vertex signs relative to an isovalue) remains foundational, though how this index is computed and how resulting triangles are formed varies.
